<title>UK: IPE natural gas untraded, market well bid.</title>
<headline>IPE natural gas untraded, market well bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The IPE natural gas contract was untraded on Thursday with the market slightly better bid than offered.</p>
<p>Price levels were little changed with bids and offers encompassing Wednesday's settlement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
